00:03:57.602 --> 00:04:00.966
This is not necessarily the case today in Hårga, but it is true that for

00:04:00.988 --> 00:04:04.554
most of human history we traveled in tribes and babies were taken care of

00:04:04.592 --> 00:04:07.674
communally. However, the Hårgan cult in Midsommar takes the focus on

00:04:07.712 --> 00:04:09.302
