00:04:15.796 --> 00:04:19.038
And even positive or negative emotions are supposed to be experienced in a

00:04:19.044 --> 00:04:22.378
group setting as a whole unit, rather than burdening them individually.

00:04:22.474 --> 00:04:25.978
Even copulation takes place in a group with several family members singing

00:04:25.994 --> 00:04:29.218
the Joys of Conception alongside the person engaging in the act.

00:04:29.304 --> 00:04:32.924
Interpersonal relationships are rejected in favor of group love among everyone. 

00:04:33.225 --> 00:04:35.966
They mostly dress in all white so that no individual person's

00:04:35.998 --> 00:04:38.050
