00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:40.866
They have special costumes that they wear for each winter and summer

00:04:40.898 --> 00:04:44.258
solstice, but because the entire movie takes place during the festival, it's

00:04:44.274 --> 00:04:47.158
not known how different these clothes are from whatever day to day garb that

00:04:47.164 --> 00:04:48.390
they wear for the rest of the year.

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:51.606
During Midsummer, at least, elders wear genderless dress robes, which are

00:04:51.628 --> 00:04:54.070
inspired by the hermaphroditic qualities found in nature.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:57.786
For example, a berry tree has both male and female components and is able to

00:04:57.808 --> 00:05:00.410
flower, self pollinate and drop seeds all on its own.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.466
It may be no coincidence that when outsiders enter the village, they are

00:05:03.488 --> 00:05:04.974
