00:05:05.012 --> 00:05:08.446
Since the cult views itself as one big unit and contains both male and

00:05:08.468 --> 00:05:12.030
female members, the cult sees itself as being hermaphroditic in a way,

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:15.918
strawberries can reproduce both sexually and asexually, and the cult takes a

00:05:15.924 --> 00:05:16.694
similar approach.

00:05:16.762 --> 00:05:19.986
They bring in outsiders to impregnate their women when they become of age in

00:05:20.008 --> 00:05:22.702
order to prevent birth defects caused by low gene variation.

00:05:22.766 --> 00:05:26.590
But they also calculatedly approve one incestuous birth per generation.

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:30.278
The result is an inbred child with physical and mental deformities who the

00:05:30.284 --> 00:05:31.842
Hårga ascribe as their oracle.

00:05:31.906 --> 00:05:35.218
Because of his or her disability, the oracle is considered to be unclouded

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:36.290
by normal cognition.

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:39.042
It makes him open for the source.

00:05:39.186 --> 00:05:42.626
The oracle paints abstract images onto this holy book, and the elders

00:05:42.658 --> 00:05:44.966
interpret the renderings as the basis for their religion.

00:05:44.998 --> 00:05:47.786
It's not clear if the elders really believe that they're interpreting the

00:05:47.808 --> 00:05:50.986
word of God through these paintings, or if this is a ruse in order to give

00:05:51.008 --> 00:05:54.334
the illusion of higher power while they're the ones actually in control.

00:05:54.452 --> 00:05:57.562
Judging by the paintings themselves, I'm leaning towards the latter.

