If we're calling the Midsummer shown in the movie 2019, then the

00:12:06.344 --> 00:12:08.870
previous May Queen would have been named in 2018.

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:14.244
[DANI] Whoa. Who's that one? [PELLE] That's last year's May Queen. [DANI] Beautiful. 

00:12:14.244 --> 00:12:16.566
There's some debate as to who this is because it's kind of hard

00:12:16.588 --> 00:12:17.522
to tell from the photo.

00:12:17.586 --> 00:12:20.598
Some believe it's Ula, the woman who opens Christian's eyes at the end of

00:12:20.604 --> 00:12:21.042
the movie.

00:12:21.042 --> 00:12:24.134
Others have said that it's Hanna, the one to pass the torch to Dani after

00:12:24.172 --> 00:12:25.282
she becomes the May Queen.

00:12:25.346 --> 00:12:28.118
There is also a possibility that she isn't around during the events of

00:12:28.124 --> 00:12:31.134
Midsommar, for whatever reason, at the end of the day, we can't really see

00:12:31.172 --> 00:12:31.678
her face.

00:12:31.764 --> 00:12:34.826
And like the list of female leads in Alfred Hitchcock movies, they're

00:12:34.858 --> 00:12:37.422
practically all young blonde woman. At the very least,

00:12:37.476 --> 00:12:40.138
we do know that there are former May Queens still in the cult.

00:12:40.234 --> 00:12:42.160
[HANNA] We should go now to see this house.

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:46.730
[DANI] What's this? [HANNA] It's a special meeting only for the Queens.

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:50.830
So that catches us up to present day or, you know, 2019.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:55.422
But to understand the 2019 Queen, we've got to take it back to her birth.

00:12:55.566 --> 00:12:57.022
Wait, we already did that transition.

00:12:57.086 --> 00:13:00.622
Danielle Ardor may have been born on June 25, 1994.

00:13:00.696 --> 00:13:02.866
We know her birthday is on her second day in Sweden.

00:13:02.898 --> 00:13:06.050
And on her first day in Sweden, Ingemar greets Pelle in Swedish.

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:08.850
However, if we look at the script, this is written in English.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:10.895
He says, happy St. John's.

00:13:10.956 --> 00:13:14.522
St. John's Day is one of the days of Midsummer and takes place on June 24.

00:13:14.576 --> 00:13:17.766
I don't speak Swedish, but if that line is in the movie, then Dani was born

00:13:17.798 --> 00:13:18.762
on the 25th.

00:13:18.816 --> 00:13:21.798
Her birth year in 1994 is not 100% official.

00:13:21.894 --> 00:13:25.630
We don't know her exact age, but the script introduces her as a 25 year old.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.398
Take that with a grain of salt, because the script goes on to say that she

00:13:28.404 --> 00:13:30.522
is a beautiful but delicate brunette.

00:13:30.586 --> 00:13:32.110
So obviously changes were made.

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:34.874
One thing that was not changed is her last name, Ardor.

00:13:34.922 --> 00:13:36.542
The name is derived from Latin roots.

00:13:36.606 --> 00:13:39.618
One definition of Ardor refers to passion and fervent love.

00:13:39.704 --> 00:13:43.102
Another, more literal definition refers to flame, fire, or heat.

00:13:43.166 --> 00:13:46.610
It's a perfect name because Dani is a character who is betrayed by her love,

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:48.450
then literally sets him on fire.

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:52.556
As mentioned, Dani has a sister named Terri who has a bad case of bipolar disorder,

00:13:52.556 --> 00:13:55.286
 resulting in numerous panic attacks that are a constant source of

00:13:55.308 --> 00:13:56.162
stress for Dani.

00:13:56.226 --> 00:14:00.800
Potentially driven to help her ill sister, Dani attends NYU as a psychology student.

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:03.754
Disaster would soon strike the Ardor family, and it would come

00:14:03.792 --> 00:14:06.410
under very suspicious circumstances.

00:14:06.683 --> 00:14:09.995
 (Impact)

00:14:11.442 --> 00:14:14.888
♪ Soft Piano Music  ♪

00:14:15.150 --> 00:14:19.858
In June 2015, Dani began dating an anthropology student named Christian Hughes.

00:14:19.858 --> 00:14:23.006
Or should I say Chris-ti-an Hughes? Dani pronounces his name the same

00:14:23.028 --> 00:14:25.002
way that Pelle does with a Swedish accent.

00:14:25.066 --> 00:14:26.990
I've noticed that the other friends don't do this.

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:29.806
This could be one of the earliest clues that she's eventually going to join

00:14:29.838 --> 00:14:31.614
the cult and become one with the Hårga.

00:14:31.662 --> 00:14:34.414
Does this mean that Pelle is actually the mastermind who controlled

00:14:34.462 --> 00:14:36.642
everything from the very beginning? I don't think so.

00:14:36.696 --> 00:14:39.930
I think Ari Aster put in a lot of details for the audience that aren't meant

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:43.865
to be used as evidence that the cult was behind every little thing, like in Hereditary. 

00:14:43.865 --> 00:14:46.358
In fact, there's an interview on HuffPost where Aster is

00:14:46.364 --> 00:14:48.886
questioned about the theory that Pelle was responsible for the deaths of

00:14:48.908 --> 00:14:51.858
Dani's parents, where he says that it's totally incorrect.

00:14:51.954 --> 00:14:54.966
Dani and Christian's relationship issues spout from the heavy emotional

00:14:54.998 --> 00:14:56.122
reliance she has on him.

00:14:56.176 --> 00:15:00.564
For all you terminally online little freaks, you may know this as trauma dumping. 

00:15:00.564 --> 00:15:02.797
[WeFoundTheBody] Trauma dumping, if you will...

00:15:02.797 --> 00:15:07.226
Christian debates breaking up with her over this, but puts those plans on hold after her trauma suddenly

00:15:07.258 --> 00:15:08.602
becomes much more valid.

00:15:08.666 --> 00:15:12.442
On December 18, she starts receiving especially weird emails from Terri.

00:15:12.506 --> 00:15:16.394
The first is a link to this National Geographic video, the first 3D VR video

00:15:16.452 --> 00:15:17.298
filmed in space.

00:15:17.384 --> 00:15:20.994
The video talks about how being on a satellite and seeing 16 sunrises a day

00:15:21.032 --> 00:15:22.910
messes up your internal body clock.

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:26.340
[Astronaut] It's strange. Your body doesn't know what time it is.

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:31.126
[Astronaut] There's no natural way to tell whether it's day or night.

00:15:31.228 --> 00:15:34.262
I think this is meant to show a parallel between what the astronauts feel

00:15:34.316 --> 00:15:38.034
with no concept of day or night, and how Dani, Christian, Mark and Josh

00:15:38.082 --> 00:15:40.770
feel in Sweden when they still see the sun out at midnight.

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:42.494
Again, I think this is here for the audience.

00:15:42.562 --> 00:15:45.174
I don't think Terri somehow knew that Dani would go to Sweden.

00:15:45.222 --> 00:15:47.082
She sends another YouTube link the next day.

00:15:47.136 --> 00:15:49.162
This one is another National Geographic video.

00:15:49.216 --> 00:15:51.414
A relaxing livestream of the Yellowstone River.

00:15:51.462 --> 00:15:54.558
Yellow is the color that represents rebirth and the cycle of life.

00:15:54.644 --> 00:15:58.963
The flowers that can be seen all over Hårga are yellow flowers called St. John's Wart.

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:00.042
This is no mistake.

00:16:00.106 --> 00:16:03.354
The script specifically calls out the bright yellow petals of these flowers.

00:16:03.402 --> 00:16:06.046
Dani passes through the yellow sungate into the village where her

00:16:06.068 --> 00:16:09.439
relationship with Christian would end and her life with her new family would begin. 

00:16:09.439 --> 00:16:12.462
Her birthday cake has a yellow candle, literally tying it to birth.

00:16:12.526 --> 00:16:15.666
According to the cult, birth and death are directly connected, which is why

00:16:15.688 --> 00:16:17.902
we also see the color yellow connected to death.

00:16:17.966 --> 00:16:21.094
The hose Terri attached to the exhaust pipe was yellow, and she passed away

00:16:21.132 --> 00:16:22.130
in a yellow shirt.

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:25.170
The parents went to sleep for the final time on yellow pillowcases.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:28.194
Dani's apartment, when she's in mourning, is totally covered in yellow,

00:16:28.242 --> 00:16:30.434
from the pillows to her blanket and lampshade.

00:16:30.482 --> 00:16:33.414
And of course, the sacrificial temple that is burned at the end of the movie

00:16:33.462 --> 00:16:34.102
is yellow.

00:16:34.166 --> 00:16:35.930
Coldplay must be going nuts right now.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:39.034
Judging by the dates of all of the emails and calls, it appears to be about

00:16:39.072 --> 00:16:42.746
December 24, when Dani gets that scary email from Terri, who stops

00:16:42.778 --> 00:16:45.694
responding at that point. After getting the news about the death of her

00:16:45.732 --> 00:16:49.440
family, Dani calls Christian and she can be heard wailing over the phone.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.970
[DANI] *Wailing sound*

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:55.466
Remember that sound? Christian does his best to be there for her, but he's

00:16:55.498 --> 00:16:58.442
just one person and he's already lost interest in the relationship.

00:16:58.596 --> 00:17:01.330
Supporting her through this tragedy is a big burden on him.

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:04.226
Dani is given the rest of the school year off in order to recover, and her

00:17:04.248 --> 00:17:06.290
and Christian stay together for several more months.

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:09.118
Although it's on hold for now, the writing is still on the wall for the end

00:17:09.144 --> 00:17:10.770
of their relationship, literally.

00:17:10.850 --> 00:17:14.114
In Dani's apartment, there's a painting of a girl in a crown kissing a bear,

00:17:14.162 --> 00:17:17.670
foreshadowing Dani's eventual crowning as the May queen and Christian's face

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:19.602
being burned alive in a bear costume.

00:17:19.666 --> 00:17:22.266
There's also a painting of these two moons, which seems to be connected to

00:17:22.288 --> 00:17:25.581
the lunar cycle and Strange Passage of Time as I mentioned earlier.

00:17:25.581 --> 00:17:27.690
Another shows a woman running naked through a forest.

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:31.212
We later see Christian running naked after realizing he's cheated on Dani.

00:17:31.212 --> 00:17:34.134
Both of these paintings are shown in winter, the opposite of summer.

00:17:34.182 --> 00:17:37.534
If you take the opposite of both paintings, you have two sons and a man

00:17:37.572 --> 00:17:39.882
running naked, which makes a lot more sense for the movie.

00:17:39.946 --> 00:17:42.462
Maybe I'm over speculating, but it feels like there's something there.

00:17:42.516 --> 00:17:45.726
In the late spring, we see a picture on the door of Dani's apartment that

00:17:45.748 --> 00:17:48.878
kind of resembles Maya, these Swedes that Christian would eventually cheat

00:17:48.894 --> 00:17:49.490
on her with.

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:53.394
In June 2019, Dani is napping and wakes up just in time to go to a small

00:17:53.432 --> 00:17:55.106
party with Christian and his friends.

00:17:55.208 --> 00:17:58.686
She learns that Pelle has invited Josh to go to Sweden to study their culture

00:17:58.718 --> 00:18:01.302
for his thesis, and Mark and Christian are going as well.

00:18:01.356 --> 00:18:04.134
Christian tries to make the plans look less concrete than they really are,

00:18:04.172 --> 00:18:07.570
but the trip is in two weeks and would last from mid June to mid July.

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:11.559
When they get home, she confronts him for not telling her and he fake apologizes.

00:18:11.559 --> 00:18:12.822
Realizing it's going to be a fight,

00:18:12.876 --> 00:18:15.130
he tries to leave, but she begs him not to.

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:18.426
She's trying way harder to make the relationship work than he is because she

00:18:18.448 --> 00:18:20.630
still needs her boyfriend as an emotional crutch.

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:24.186
Eventually, his guilt causes him to just invite Dani to Sweden to make

00:18:24.208 --> 00:18:27.738
things less weird, and she surprises him by accepting the invitation.

00:18:27.834 --> 00:18:30.810
She goes over to Mark and Josh's apartment to talk about the trip.

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:34.410
There you'll see a book on the table, the Secret Nazi Language of Uthark.

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:35.562
And look, it's yellow.

00:18:35.626 --> 00:18:38.622
The uthark theory is a theory about deciphering runic alphabets.

00:18:38.686 --> 00:18:40.942
It's part of the purpose of Josh's travels to Sweden.

00:18:41.006 --> 00:18:44.018
Learning about the runic alphabet is a big part of his thesis paper.

00:18:44.104 --> 00:18:46.674
The mention of the secret Nazi language is interesting.

00:18:46.792 --> 00:18:50.374
The word Nazi is short for this really long German word that translates to

00:18:50.412 --> 00:18:51.458
National Socialism.

00:18:51.554 --> 00:18:55.442
Socialism is the idea of collective ownership rather than individual ownership.

00:18:55.442 --> 00:18:57.526
If you've heard of the Nazis, you know that their main goal was

00:18:57.548 --> 00:18:58.182
to seize power.

00:18:58.236 --> 00:18:59.954
So they're technically not socialist.

00:19:00.002 --> 00:19:02.618
They're just using that in their title because it was a popular buzzword at

00:19:02.624 --> 00:19:04.442
the time in Germany, from what I understand.

00:19:04.576 --> 00:19:07.878
In essence, the whole situation isn't very different from how the Hårga

00:19:07.894 --> 00:19:11.174
elders named Ruben as the Oracle, but they were still the ones to interpret

00:19:11.222 --> 00:19:12.582
his Nothing Burger paintings.

00:19:12.646 --> 00:19:15.774
So essentially they had the power while making it look like somebody else

00:19:15.812 --> 00:19:16.510
held the power.

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:19.818
Unlike the Nazis, however, the Hårga are full on socialists.

00:19:19.914 --> 00:19:22.350
Usually, socialism applies to the economic model.

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:25.854
Socialists might collectively share land, money, businesses, et cetera.

00:19:25.902 --> 00:19:28.898
The Hårga have essentially expanded this to all aspects of life.

00:19:28.984 --> 00:19:33.434
They collectively share emotions, relationship partners, food and living arrangements.  

00:19:33.434 --> 00:19:34.802
This is a politics free channel.

00:19:34.856 --> 00:19:37.086
I'm not trying to sell you on any political ideas.

00:19:37.118 --> 00:19:39.382
I'm just trying to explain why this book is here.

00:19:39.436 --> 00:19:42.258
The script is a little more overt about the Nazi comparison.

00:19:42.354 --> 00:19:45.266
Josh asks, Are the Swedes sensitive about their history of Nazi

00:19:45.298 --> 00:19:49.286
collaboration? To which Pelle responds are you sensitive about Hiroshima or

00:19:49.308 --> 00:19:51.258
slavery or the Trail of Tears?

00:19:51.258 --> 00:19:53.942
This could also potentially be connected to how bloodlines are handled.

00:19:54.006 --> 00:19:56.566
One of the villagers mentions that the elders are careful to preserve

00:19:56.598 --> 00:19:59.738
bloodlines, which was one of the main goals of the Nazi Party to create a

00:19:59.744 --> 00:20:00.470
master race.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:03.618
The cult in the movie is almost exclusively made up of people with pale

00:20:03.654 --> 00:20:05.358
skin, light hair and light eyes.

00:20:05.444 --> 00:20:09.086
Lo and behold, the only outsider that they allow to survive is Dani, who

00:20:09.108 --> 00:20:11.306
fits right in with their genealogical traits.

00:20:11.418 --> 00:20:14.718
Anyway, as Pelle explains his homeland to Dani, he's the only one in the

00:20:14.724 --> 00:20:16.938
group that seems genuinely warm towards her.

00:20:17.044 --> 00:20:19.794
- [PELLE] You know, I'm very, very glad you're coming.

00:20:19.912 --> 00:20:21.506
- [PELLE] Think it's very good you're coming.

00:20:21.608 --> 00:20:24.974
He starts to bring up how sorry he was to hear that Dani lost her parents,

00:20:25.022 --> 00:20:28.350
but she gets choked up and has to leave to compose herself in the bathroom.

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:31.618
It feels like he has a thing for her, and he probably does, but he doesn't

00:20:31.634 --> 00:20:35.058
get a chance to explain why he's happy to have Dani specifically joining

00:20:35.074 --> 00:20:35.842
them on the trip.

00:20:35.906 --> 00:20:36.886
We'll get to that.

00:20:36.988 --> 00:20:39.898
After once again being overwhelmed with sadness on the plane, Dani and the

00:20:39.904 --> 00:20:43.194
group land in Sweden and hit the road towards housingland, where fear and

00:20:43.232 --> 00:20:44.940
loathing would await them.

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:45.440
(impact)

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:53.302
♪ Folk Music ♪

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:57.146
As Dani, Christian, Pelle, Josh, and Mark make their way to Pelle's commune,

00:20:57.178 --> 00:21:01.178
a sign overhead can be translated to stop mass immigration to house England.

00:21:01.274 --> 00:21:04.014
This is their first clue that they're not as welcome as they think they are.

00:21:04.052 --> 00:21:07.326
As tourists, they take a rest stop where they run into some Hårgan people

00:21:07.348 --> 00:21:10.546
that Pelle knows who are also coming home for Midsummer, one of which is his

00:21:10.568 --> 00:21:11.550
brother Ingemar.

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:14.846
This is not to say that Pelle and Ingemar necessarily have the same parents,

00:21:14.878 --> 00:21:19.233
but the cult is referred to as a family, as cults so often do to avoid suspicion.

00:21:19.233 --> 00:21:21.846
So everyone your age is considered a brother or sister, and

00:21:21.868 --> 00:21:23.682
elders are considered mothers or fathers.

00:21:23.746 --> 00:21:26.834
Ingemar also has two guests from the UK, Simon and Connie.

00:21:26.882 --> 00:21:29.846
They're all going to take some magic mushrooms together, but Dani wants to

00:21:29.868 --> 00:21:31.302
wait in order to get her foot in.

00:21:31.356 --> 00:21:34.378
Christian says that he'll wait with her, which upsets Mark, who insists that

00:21:34.378 --> 00:21:38.461
they need to take them at the same time in order to experience the effect simultaneously. 

00:21:38.461 --> 00:21:40.634
Ari Aster is drawing a parallel here between the friend

00:21:40.672 --> 00:21:41.498
group and the cult.

00:21:41.584 --> 00:21:45.370
The cult experiences things like joy and sorrow together simultaneously.

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:49.401
Notice how Mark doesn't object until Christian says that he's going to wait with Dani.

00:21:49.466 --> 00:21:52.714
Mark doesn't view Dani as part of their family, causing her to eventually

00:21:52.762 --> 00:21:54.878
feel more at home as part of the Hårgan family.

00:21:54.964 --> 00:21:57.778
In this case, Dani doesn't want to get in the way, so she offers to take the

00:21:57.784 --> 00:21:59.266
mushrooms alongside the others.

00:21:59.368 --> 00:22:02.414
Later on, they're chilling on the hillside, and Mark gets hypersensitive

00:22:02.462 --> 00:22:04.130
when somebody walks up to them.

00:22:04.280 --> 00:22:06.180
- [MARK] I don't want new people right now.

00:22:07.030 --> 00:22:09.314
- [PELLE] No, new people are good ones.

00:22:09.432 --> 00:22:12.454
Of course, Pelle would say that he literally needs to bring new people into

00:22:12.492 --> 00:22:14.326
the cult in order for their family to continue.

00:22:14.428 --> 00:22:17.846
Dani just seems kind of spaced out in days during all of this until she

00:22:17.868 --> 00:22:21.042
sees grass growing on the back of her hand, textures moving on, trees,

00:22:21.106 --> 00:22:24.630
warping, landscapes, and the sounds of nature suddenly stopping.

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:29.480
You're like my real, actual family.

00:22:30.290 --> 00:22:33.166
When she hears Mark say that, I think she's pulled out of the moment and

00:22:33.188 --> 00:22:36.238
reminded about the tragedy that befell her own family, and she seems to

00:22:36.244 --> 00:22:37.242
think she's going to die.

00:22:37.306 --> 00:22:40.378
In a panic, she gets up and says she's going for a walk, eventually ending

00:22:40.394 --> 00:22:43.246
up in an outhouse, where she sees the frightening image of her sister with

00:22:43.268 --> 00:22:45.130
the gas hose plastered over her mouth.

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:48.526
This freaks her out, and she runs into the woods and falls asleep dreaming

00:22:48.558 --> 00:22:49.870
about her parents and sister.

00:22:49.950 --> 00:22:52.674
The next thing she knows, they're waking her up, explaining that they found

00:22:52.712 --> 00:22:54.130
her in the field 6 hours ago.

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:56.350
But Christian doesn't wish her a happy birthday.

00:22:56.430 --> 00:22:59.506
The last part of the journey is on foot before they come through the Sun gate

00:22:59.538 --> 00:23:02.626
to find a picturesque village where they're greeted by flutists performing

00:23:02.658 --> 00:23:03.686
sweet folk music.

00:23:03.788 --> 00:23:06.066
Pelle introduces them to his sister Dagny.

00:23:06.098 --> 00:23:09.238
It feels significant that the first person he chooses to introduce is a

00:23:09.244 --> 00:23:12.266
sister with a similar name to Dani, almost like he's demonstrating that

00:23:12.288 --> 00:23:14.135
someone like her could be a part of the family.

00:23:14.224 --> 00:23:19.066
Dani also attempts to respond to her in Swedish, a foreshadowing of her

00:23:19.088 --> 00:23:23.193
eventual ability to apparently communicate with the sisters in their own language.

00:23:23.193 --> 00:23:25.754
Next, Pelle introduces Father Odd, who tells each of the boys

00:23:25.802 --> 00:23:26.526
welcome, but for.

00:23:26.548 --> 00:23:28.958
Dani gives her a hug and says welcome home.

00:23:29.044 --> 00:23:33.566
Music directs their attention to a gathering under the giant Maypole, where

00:23:33.588 --> 00:23:35.418
they toast to the beginning of the festivities.

00:23:35.514 --> 00:23:39.090
Later that day, all of the foreigners sit out on blankets as the villagers dance around.

00:23:39.208 --> 00:23:43.549
Dani watches as one of the dancing women, Maya, kicks her boyfriend in the side.

00:23:43.549 --> 00:23:45.970
He asks Pelle if he can join in, and he and Josh run off.

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:49.138
Pelle takes this opportunity to give Dani a birthday gift, a portrait that

00:23:49.144 --> 00:23:49.874
he's drawn of her.

00:23:49.912 --> 00:23:53.206
He tells her it's just between them, and she has to awkwardly explain how

00:23:53.228 --> 00:23:54.850
Christian forgot that it was her birthday.

00:23:54.930 --> 00:23:58.006
Pelle is continuing to plant the seeds that Dani will be treated better as a

00:23:58.028 --> 00:24:01.010
family member of the Hårga than she is in a relationship with Christian.

00:24:01.090 --> 00:24:04.026
This seed continues to grow later that day, when Connie asks how long

00:24:04.048 --> 00:24:06.698
they've been together and Christian says that it's been about three and a

00:24:06.704 --> 00:24:10.074
half years, dany corrects him, explaining that it's actually been four years

00:24:10.112 --> 00:24:13.626
and two weeks, meaning that not only did he forget her birthday, but he also

00:24:13.648 --> 00:24:14.762
forgot their anniversary.

00:24:14.826 --> 00:24:17.790
Connie and Simon share that they're engaged, and upon hearing that word,

00:24:17.860 --> 00:24:19.482
Dani overreacts with excitement.

00:24:19.546 --> 00:24:22.638
While Christian hardly seems to pay this any mind, more interested in the

00:24:22.644 --> 00:24:26.418
triangle shaped temple in the distance, which he's told nobody is allowed inside.

00:24:26.418 --> 00:24:27.746
Don't worry, man, you'll get your chance.

00:24:27.848 --> 00:24:31.026
Subscribers of this channel already know that this wasn't the first time a

00:24:31.048 --> 00:24:34.606
triangle was associated with secret cult activity in an Ari Aster film.

00:24:34.638 --> 00:24:37.230
As this was also something I discussed when covering Hereditary.

00:24:37.310 --> 00:24:40.626
I also noticed that Mark is using a vape throughout the film, to the Hårga,

00:24:40.658 --> 00:24:41.634
he's an outsider.

00:24:41.682 --> 00:24:45.014
In Hereditary, outsiders gather around the house of the Graham family, and

00:24:45.052 --> 00:24:47.554
similarly, we can see their breath. Only in Hereditary,

00:24:47.602 --> 00:24:49.192
it is because of the cold.

00:24:49.192 --> 00:24:52.746
At the main house, Pelle explains the system of different age ranges being represented by

00:24:52.768 --> 00:24:57.223
seasons, and when Dani asks what happens after 72, he does a cutthroat motion.

00:24:57.223 --> 00:24:59.818
She laughs, thinking that he's just joking, completely unaware of

00:24:59.824 --> 00:25:01.850
the ceremony that would take place the next day.

00:25:01.920 --> 00:25:05.214
But before Dani's birthday celebration comes to a close, Christian finally

00:25:05.252 --> 00:25:08.826
remembers to wish her a happy birthday, unenthusiastically giving her a cake

00:25:08.858 --> 00:25:10.522
as he struggles to light the candle.

00:25:10.586 --> 00:25:14.377
The scene represents how the flame between them is dying, and literally between them.

00:25:14.388 --> 00:25:17.858
In the shot, we see five women all nurturing a baby together as one.

00:25:17.944 --> 00:25:21.186
The shot visually demonstrates how the appeal of always having a family to

00:25:21.208 --> 00:25:24.886
care for you is coming between them and their one on one romantic relationship.

00:25:24.886 --> 00:25:27.342
Even if Dani doesn't realize what's going on yet.

00:25:27.406 --> 00:25:31.710
Christian weekly apologizes for forgetting, claiming he got confused by the constant daylight. 

00:25:31.710 --> 00:25:34.118
That daylight is blocked out at bedtime that evening so they can

00:25:34.124 --> 00:25:34.802
get some sleep.

00:25:34.866 --> 00:25:37.474
Dani sees a pair of scissors placed under a baby's pillow.

00:25:37.522 --> 00:25:39.382
It seems unsafe, and it is.

00:25:39.436 --> 00:25:40.150
Don't try it.

00:25:40.220 --> 00:25:42.630
I was able to find a possible explanation for this.

00:25:42.700 --> 00:25:45.894
Some believe that placing scissors under your pillow can prevent bad dreams,

00:25:45.942 --> 00:25:48.826
which would make sense considering that they all sleep in one room and would

00:25:48.848 --> 00:25:51.386
probably want to avoid the baby crying in the middle of the night.

00:25:51.488 --> 00:25:55.518
However, this superstition seems to only exist in Egypt or China, and I

00:25:55.524 --> 00:25:58.234
couldn't find anything linking it to Sweden, so I kept searching.

00:25:58.282 --> 00:26:01.838
Eventually, I came across this scene where Dani talks to a woman cradling a

00:26:01.844 --> 00:26:03.070
baby that is not her own.

00:26:03.140 --> 00:26:05.886
She explains that part of the reason that birth parents go away on

00:26:05.908 --> 00:26:09.138
pilgrimage is that the time away helps the babies detach, allowing them to

00:26:09.144 --> 00:26:10.242
be raised by the community.

00:26:10.376 --> 00:26:13.986
This comment by TheWitch666 on Reddit suggests that the scissors under

00:26:14.008 --> 00:26:17.346
the pillow may symbolize the cutting or detaching from the parent, just as

00:26:17.368 --> 00:26:21.157
you literally cut the umbilical cord when the baby is ready to survive on his or her own.

00:26:21.244 --> 00:26:24.918
Pelle hints that there's a big ceremony the next day, and Dani's only clue is

00:26:24.924 --> 00:26:27.986
that it seems to be getting a big reaction out of Josh, the devout cultural

00:26:28.018 --> 00:26:29.158
anthropology student.

00:26:29.244 --> 00:26:31.170
However, he refuses to spill the beans.

00:26:31.250 --> 00:26:34.454
In the night, Dani awakes to the sound of the crying baby and sees the mural

00:26:34.502 --> 00:26:38.793
of a smiling man opening his wrist with a knife while surrounded by smiling friends.

00:26:38.793 --> 00:26:40.442
Even the sun is smiling down on them.

00:26:40.496 --> 00:26:43.290
This would be her first clue about how this group feels about human

00:26:43.360 --> 00:26:45.998
sacrifice. They're proud of it, and it's a part of life.

00:26:46.084 --> 00:26:49.194
The next day, she takes notice as the villagers perform some kind of ritual,

00:26:49.242 --> 00:26:51.847
which is described as a dance class in the script.

00:26:51.847 --> 00:26:53.966
The group imitates the movements of the leader, which I see

00:26:53.988 --> 00:26:57.588
as practice for when they need to share the burden of a family member's emotions. 

00:26:57.588 --> 00:26:59.966
Dani picks some flowers for Christian before that morning's

00:26:59.998 --> 00:27:01.870
feast, which she picked while walking backwards.

00:27:01.950 --> 00:27:05.026
Just like the Hårga woman, she's showing more and more signs that she is

00:27:05.048 --> 00:27:06.510
assimilating into their culture.

00:27:06.590 --> 00:27:09.634
At this meal, special emphasis is placed on these two elders.

00:27:09.682 --> 00:27:12.358
After eating and performing some strange chants, they're led to the

00:27:12.364 --> 00:27:15.766
cliffside where Dani and the other Western hailing guests are in for a

00:27:15.788 --> 00:27:17.430
serious culture shock.

00:27:18.167 --> 00:27:20.027
(impact)

00:27:22.921 --> 00:27:26.731
♪ Mysterious Music ♪

00:27:27.168 --> 00:27:32.017
Even before experiencing her first attestupa ritual, Dani looks nervous and uncomfortable.

00:27:32.017 --> 00:27:34.506
It's as if she knows that something is wrong, much like how

00:27:34.528 --> 00:27:37.614
she knew there was an issue after receiving that email from her sister

00:27:37.652 --> 00:27:38.330
six months prior.

00:27:38.410 --> 00:27:41.642
Aster is drawing attention to the similarities between the two scenes.

00:27:41.706 --> 00:27:44.846
There's even a character who breaks the fourth wall, just like Terri did in

00:27:44.868 --> 00:27:45.642
Danny's dream.

00:27:45.706 --> 00:27:47.326
When she sees the first elder jump.

00:27:47.358 --> 00:27:51.054
She gasps and grabs Christian's hand, and her entire world goes spinning.

00:27:51.102 --> 00:27:54.738
When the male elder jumps, he doesn't die, but instead breaks his leg at the

00:27:54.744 --> 00:27:55.454
base of the cliff.

00:27:55.502 --> 00:27:59.334
So the entire cult moans in agony alongside him until four of them go over

00:27:59.372 --> 00:28:01.474
there and finish the job with a giant hammer.

00:28:01.522 --> 00:28:05.126
This is Dani's first time seeing this concept of group suffering, and she

00:28:05.148 --> 00:28:07.058
would eventually experience it for herself.

00:28:07.154 --> 00:28:10.982
Connie and Simon are especially offended, so Siv, the family matriarch,

00:28:11.046 --> 00:28:15.139
tries to explain that the end of life is actually a great joy in their culture.

00:28:15.139 --> 00:28:18.406
- [SIV] We view life as a circle, a recycle.

00:28:18.518 --> 00:28:21.978
Then she makes direct eye contact with Dani, almost as if she's trying to

00:28:21.984 --> 00:28:23.518
sell this lifestyle to her.

00:28:23.604 --> 00:28:27.470
- [SIV] It does no good dodging lashing back at the inevitable.

00:28:27.810 --> 00:28:29.722
- [SIV] It corrupts the spirit.

00:28:29.866 --> 00:28:32.666
Given that she just spent the last half of a year in misery and mourning,

00:28:32.698 --> 00:28:36.845
this gives Dani a lot to think about, and she breaks off on her own during the hike back.

00:28:36.845 --> 00:28:38.626
Christian leaves her alone to cry, and she's so

00:28:38.648 --> 00:28:40.622
distraught that she struggles to even breathe.

00:28:40.686 --> 00:28:44.174
When she comes back to the commune, she begins packing up to leave, but Pelle

00:28:44.222 --> 00:28:44.722
shows up.

00:28:44.776 --> 00:28:48.034
Once again, Dani breaks down, telling him she doesn't know why she's here,

00:28:48.072 --> 00:28:51.686
and Pelle finally gets the opportunity to explain why he was most excited for

00:28:51.708 --> 00:28:52.758
her to come out of everyone.

00:28:52.844 --> 00:28:55.718
He tells her that he knows what she's going through because he lost his

00:28:55.724 --> 00:28:57.622
parents, too, in a fire when he was little.

00:28:57.676 --> 00:29:00.774
He's probably neglecting to mention that this was a controlled fire, another

00:29:00.812 --> 00:29:01.922
ritual sacrifice.

00:29:01.986 --> 00:29:05.098
But he's trying to show her that their way of life may be better for her.

00:29:05.184 --> 00:29:10.090
- [PELLE] I never got the chance to feel lost because I had a family here where

00:29:10.160 --> 00:29:13.100
- [PELLE] everyone embraced me and swept me up.

00:29:13.470 --> 00:29:18.727
- [PELLE] And I was raised by a community that doesn't bicker over what's theirs and what's not theirs.

00:29:18.810 --> 00:29:21.566
This refers to Josh and Christian fighting over the ownership of their

00:29:21.588 --> 00:29:23.618
thesis idea and refusing to work together.

00:29:23.704 --> 00:29:31.965
- [PELLE] But I have always felt held by a family, a real family, which everyone deserves.

00:29:31.965 --> 00:29:32.814
- [PELLE] You deserve.

00:29:32.862 --> 00:29:36.306
He holds her hands, and she becomes worried that Christian could walk in, to

00:29:36.328 --> 00:29:40.277
which he directly challenges their relationship, asking if she feels held by him.

00:29:40.277 --> 00:29:43.458
He's using their dying relationship to try to recruit her to the cult.

00:29:43.554 --> 00:29:45.461
- [PELLE] Does he feel like home to you? 

00:29:45.461 --> 00:29:47.148
When she does talk to Christian about these

00:29:47.148 --> 00:29:49.878
sacrifices that they witnessed that day, he tells her that he's trying to

00:29:49.884 --> 00:29:52.902
keep an open mind and acclimate, not realizing that he's actually

00:29:52.956 --> 00:29:55.482
encouraging her to do exactly what Pelle wants her to do.

00:29:55.536 --> 00:29:57.590
That night, she borrows a sleeping pill from Josh.

00:29:57.670 --> 00:30:00.965
She has a nightmare where she sees her friends leaving in the car without her.

00:30:00.965 --> 00:30:03.706
This is also where she screams out black smoke and visualizes her

00:30:03.728 --> 00:30:05.394
family dying at the bottom of the cliff.

00:30:05.462 --> 00:30:07.054
The pill causes her to sleep in.

00:30:07.092 --> 00:30:10.378
So she misses Josh discovering the love rune that Maya placed on Christian's

00:30:10.394 --> 00:30:13.802
bed and Mark getting in trouble for pissing on the sacred ancestral tree.

00:30:13.866 --> 00:30:17.578
She's just waking up as Connie storms in to pack her bags, clearly offended

00:30:17.594 --> 00:30:19.262
by the idea of human sacrifice.

00:30:19.326 --> 00:30:22.434
Father Odd comes up and informs Connie that Simon went on to the train

00:30:22.472 --> 00:30:25.362
station without her and that he'll be sending the truck back to get her,

00:30:25.416 --> 00:30:26.914
which doesn't really make sense.

00:30:27.032 --> 00:30:30.886
Dani is understandably disturbed by this and later tells Christian, but he

00:30:30.908 --> 00:30:33.846
doesn't react much, which shows his lack of empathy, especially in

00:30:33.868 --> 00:30:34.882
comparison to Pelle.

00:30:34.946 --> 00:30:37.810
He goes right back to interviewing one of the villagers for his thesis.

00:30:37.890 --> 00:30:41.334
Dani has this moment where she looks like she's realizing he isn't the guy

00:30:41.372 --> 00:30:42.278
she thinks he is.

00:30:42.364 --> 00:30:45.866
She wanders around outside the kitchen and is invited to come in and help.

00:30:45.968 --> 00:30:48.922
In this scene, Dani can be observed taking in the scent of this small

00:30:48.976 --> 00:30:52.714
satchet. We saw Pelle offer this to her earlier, saying that it'll calm her

00:30:52.752 --> 00:30:54.122
down, but she refuses it.

00:30:54.176 --> 00:30:57.566
As usual, the script offers more insight, telling us that it contains a

00:30:57.588 --> 00:30:58.282
special herb.

00:30:58.346 --> 00:31:01.166
Knowing what we know now, it can be assumed that this herb is meant to have

00:31:01.188 --> 00:31:04.250
some kind of effect, such as opening her up to the cult's influence.

00:31:04.330 --> 00:31:06.718
She goes inside and helps prepare meat tarts.

00:31:06.814 --> 00:31:10.270
But what kind of meat? And Maya can be seen setting one aside.

00:31:10.350 --> 00:31:13.570
As she takes them out of the oven, she hears screaming in the distance.

00:31:13.570 --> 00:31:15.626
[Audible scream]

00:31:15.750 --> 00:31:18.862
At supper, Dani is concerned about Connie, who is now missing.

00:31:18.926 --> 00:31:22.326
She questions why Simon would leave without her and tells Christian that she

00:31:22.348 --> 00:31:23.510
could see him doing that.

00:31:23.580 --> 00:31:26.806
The seating arrangement with her between Christian and Pelle mirrors their

00:31:26.828 --> 00:31:29.842
sleeping arrangement and represents her growing internal conflict.

00:31:29.906 --> 00:31:33.322
Which way will Dani go? Christian finds a hair in his pie, which Mark

00:31:33.376 --> 00:31:35.863
identifies as a pubic hair, somehow.

00:31:35.863 --> 00:31:38.554
You'll also notice that his drink is a slightly different color than

00:31:38.592 --> 00:31:39.382
everyone else's.

00:31:39.446 --> 00:31:42.986
This all ties back to the so called love story, a sort of comic on display

00:31:43.018 --> 00:31:48.234
in the village, where a girl mixes hair into a guy's food and certain bodily

00:31:48.282 --> 00:31:52.478
fluids into his drink to hypnotize him into marrying and knocking her up.

00:31:52.564 --> 00:31:54.378
This is Maya's plan for Christian.

00:31:54.474 --> 00:31:57.984
I'm guessing she has never read Harry Potter and the Half-Blood Prince.

00:31:57.984 --> 00:32:00.078
Dani once again uses a sleeping pill to snooze

00:32:00.094 --> 00:32:01.250
through the events in the night.

00:32:01.320 --> 00:32:04.222
When she wakes up, the first thing she sees is Pelle changing.

00:32:04.286 --> 00:32:06.078
Surely this can't be a coincidence.

00:32:06.174 --> 00:32:09.214
At breakfast, one of the elders says that a book from the temple is missing,

00:32:09.262 --> 00:32:12.678
and Christian and Dani are confronted about their friends Josh and Mark, who

00:32:12.684 --> 00:32:14.676
have also gone missing in the night.

00:32:14.676 --> 00:32:17.014
Christian tells them that he doesn't associate as friends or

00:32:17.052 --> 00:32:20.166
associates of Josh if he stole the book, further explaining that he'd be

00:32:20.188 --> 00:32:22.170
embarrassed to be connected to this in any way.

00:32:22.240 --> 00:32:25.642
How ironic that the one supposedly studying this culture for his college

00:32:25.696 --> 00:32:29.270
papers still doesn't understand that everything is communal in the culture.

00:32:29.350 --> 00:32:32.230
There's no personal responsibility in these people's minds.

00:32:32.310 --> 00:32:35.758
Dani is told to go with the women for the day's activity and Siv wants to

00:32:35.764 --> 00:32:37.118
see Christian in her house.

00:32:37.204 --> 00:32:40.478
Christian seems to accept this as if it's out of his hands and it's an

00:32:40.484 --> 00:32:41.710
awkward moment for all.

00:32:41.780 --> 00:32:43.546
This is when the yellow tea is brewed.

00:32:43.578 --> 00:32:47.583
The women are dressed in floral crowns and Dani is given traditional clothing.

00:32:47.583 --> 00:32:49.502
The next step towards her integrating into the cult.

00:32:49.566 --> 00:32:52.754
They all join hands and circle around the May Pole and she gets very

00:32:52.792 --> 00:32:55.986
uncomfortable and sees grass growing out of her feet, just like when she

00:32:56.008 --> 00:32:58.110
took the mushrooms upon arriving in Sweden.

00:32:58.190 --> 00:33:01.234
As she's becoming more and more a part of the Hårga family, she's becoming

00:33:01.282 --> 00:33:04.694
one with nature as their religion is deeply tied to nature in how they break

00:33:04.732 --> 00:33:07.894
their lives into seasons, wear clothing inspired by nature, et cetera.

00:33:07.942 --> 00:33:10.790
The rules are explained and the Hårgalåten dance begins.

00:33:10.870 --> 00:33:13.900
Not long into it, Dani straight up bodies some chick

00:33:14.950 --> 00:33:18.830
♪ Metal Music ♪

00:33:18.830 --> 00:33:19.834
if you're looking for it.

00:33:19.872 --> 00:33:23.094
Maya seems to fall on purpose which would fit into the plan of her hooking

00:33:23.142 --> 00:33:25.854
up with Christian as the May Queen celebrations take place.

00:33:25.972 --> 00:33:29.326
Speaking of whom, Christian watches from the sidelines when Dani makes the

00:33:29.348 --> 00:33:29.902
Elite Eight.

00:33:29.956 --> 00:33:33.550
She looks into the crowd and sees everyone cheering besides her boyfriend.

00:33:33.630 --> 00:33:36.850
When the dancing starts again, Ulla hands Christian a drink.

00:33:39.910 --> 00:33:45.182
- [ULLA] Spring water with special properties.

00:33:45.182 --> 00:33:48.462
She tells him it breaks down your defenses and opens you up for influence.

00:33:48.526 --> 00:33:51.682
In that sense, it really is very similar to the herbs from Hereditary.

00:33:51.746 --> 00:33:55.868
The difference being instead of supernatural influence, it's psychoactive influence.

00:33:55.868 --> 00:33:58.146
I think a lot of people are quick to shout cinematic universe

00:33:58.178 --> 00:33:59.442
when it comes to Ari Aster

00:33:59.506 --> 00:34:02.778
But if you think about it, nothing in Midsommar merits the existence of the

00:34:02.784 --> 00:34:04.618
supernatural or any higher power.

00:34:04.704 --> 00:34:08.022
Even when Dani somehow begins speaking Swedish with the other contestants

00:34:08.086 --> 00:34:11.002
it's suggested that this is just a hallucination and they're actually

00:34:11.056 --> 00:34:12.406
communicating through dance.

00:34:12.518 --> 00:34:15.930
In fact, in the script they're actually just speaking complete gibberish.

00:34:16.010 --> 00:34:19.974
The last two Swedish girls collide and fall down so Dani is declared the winner.

00:34:19.974 --> 00:34:22.430
But it wouldn't be long before the celebration would be cut short

00:34:22.500 --> 00:34:24.190
with crippling grief.

00:34:24.463 --> 00:34:27.065
(impact)

00:34:29.524 --> 00:34:32.930
♪ Folk Music ♪

00:34:32.930 --> 00:34:37.252
Dani is crowned as the May Queen, which comes as a complete surprise to her

00:34:37.252 --> 00:34:38.206
The celebration begins.

00:34:38.318 --> 00:34:42.134
Father Odd repeatedly tells her welcome and Maya touches foreheads with her.

00:34:42.172 --> 00:34:45.702
This shows that Dani is being accepted into the cult by doing what they do.

00:34:45.756 --> 00:34:46.630
She is one of them.

00:34:46.700 --> 00:34:49.730
However, she's still feeling the effects of the mind altering beverage.

00:34:49.810 --> 00:34:51.398
Ingemar's eyes look huge.

00:34:51.484 --> 00:34:55.082
Then she sees what appears to be her father with completely mismatched eyes

00:34:55.136 --> 00:34:56.950
and her mother passing through the crowd.

00:34:57.030 --> 00:34:58.502
Pelle kisses her on the lips.

00:34:58.566 --> 00:35:01.658
Now that she's been recruited to the cult, it's not weird because of how the

00:35:01.664 --> 00:35:03.402
family all shares their love for each other.

00:35:03.456 --> 00:35:06.078
There's no concept of belonging to a specific person.

00:35:06.164 --> 00:35:10.634
As Dani is lifted onto the pedestal, I'm fairly certain that's Terri standing to her right.

00:35:10.634 --> 00:35:11.134
Through all of this,

00:35:11.172 --> 00:35:14.158
Christian just watches in the distance, totally spaced out.

00:35:14.244 --> 00:35:18.046
At one point, Pelle had asked her if she felt held by Christian and now she's

00:35:18.078 --> 00:35:20.066
literally being held up by her new family.

00:35:20.168 --> 00:35:23.362
There's some kind of meat being served at the feast, possibly their friends

00:35:23.416 --> 00:35:25.138
who were taken out the previous night.

00:35:25.224 --> 00:35:27.042
The meat has flies buzzing around it.

00:35:27.096 --> 00:35:30.278
One last time, I've got to mention how I'm reminded of Hereditary where the

00:35:30.284 --> 00:35:33.138
body riding in the attic attracts an insane amount of flies.

00:35:33.234 --> 00:35:36.306
From overhead, one of the platters looks like a woman, which is fitting

00:35:36.338 --> 00:35:37.958
considering what's about to take place.

00:35:38.044 --> 00:35:41.558
The May Queen is going to bless the crops and livestock and Christian is

00:35:41.564 --> 00:35:42.774
going to impregnate Maya.

00:35:42.822 --> 00:35:44.678
Both are tied to the idea of fertility.

00:35:44.774 --> 00:35:47.606
The table which has been rearranged to take the shape of various runes

00:35:47.638 --> 00:35:51.594
throughout Dani's time in Sweden is now one straight long line, maybe for

00:35:51.632 --> 00:35:53.478
similar reasons to the shape of the May Pole.

00:35:53.574 --> 00:35:57.998
Dani attempts to eat the lucky herring, but doesn't get far and everyone laughs.

00:35:57.998 --> 00:36:00.279
It seems fitting that she rejects the fish.

00:36:00.279 --> 00:36:03.775
A fish is often used as a symbol to represent Christianity, the religion.

00:36:03.775 --> 00:36:06.846
Dani's soon to be ex-boyfriend is named Christian and she's

00:36:06.878 --> 00:36:09.294
literally moving from him to a Pagan religion.

00:36:09.342 --> 00:36:12.498
Dagny, the first sister that Pelle introduced at the beginning, is also the

00:36:12.504 --> 00:36:14.370
first one to call Dani a sister.

00:36:16.150 --> 00:36:17.490
- [Dagny] You are the family now.

00:36:17.560 --> 00:36:20.194
- [Dagny] Yes, you are the family.

00:36:20.312 --> 00:36:23.122
Pelle also makes a drawing of Dani as the May Queen.

00:36:23.186 --> 00:36:26.134
Previously he stated that drawing portraits is something that he does for

00:36:26.172 --> 00:36:29.526
birthday. This signifies how she's been reborn into her new family.

00:36:29.628 --> 00:36:33.578
Just as a family views life as cyclical, relationships also operate in a

00:36:33.584 --> 00:36:37.334
cycle. Dani's relationship has been dying for some time, but like an elder

00:36:37.382 --> 00:36:40.778
in a nursing home, this relationship's best years are already gone.

00:36:40.864 --> 00:36:44.106
The Hårga say goodbye to their elders before that can happen, and they do

00:36:44.128 --> 00:36:46.142
the same to Dani and Christian's relationship.

00:36:46.276 --> 00:36:49.726
A chariot comes to take Dani to perform the blessings and she asks if

00:36:49.748 --> 00:36:52.814
Christian can come with her, to which Siv informs her

00:36:52.814 --> 00:36:55.162
- [SIV] Nay, the Queen must ride alone.

00:36:55.226 --> 00:36:57.618
When they set off, the carriage is pulled by only women.

00:36:57.704 --> 00:37:01.042
And while she's gone, Christian is lured into the temple, where he finally

00:37:01.096 --> 00:37:04.290
succumbs to Maya's plot along with several other women.

00:37:04.360 --> 00:37:08.454
It wouldn't be an A 24 film without a bunch of creepy naked people, would it?

00:37:08.454 --> 00:37:10.978
When Dani returns from the chariot trip, she's told to go to Siv's

00:37:10.994 --> 00:37:14.214
house for a special meeting for the May Queens, but notices that something

00:37:14.252 --> 00:37:15.586
is going on at the temple.

00:37:15.698 --> 00:37:18.006
- [DANI] What's that? 
- [SIV] It's not for us.

00:37:18.108 --> 00:37:21.734
She ignores this advice and goes there anyways, looking distraught, almost

00:37:21.772 --> 00:37:24.042
as if she already knows what's going on inside.

00:37:24.176 --> 00:37:27.386
This is the third time we've seen her freak out before, a tragedy which

00:37:27.408 --> 00:37:31.125
serves to connect this with the death of her parents and her witnessing the attestupa.

00:37:31.125 --> 00:37:33.702
She looks into the keyhole and confirms her suspicions.

00:37:33.766 --> 00:37:37.466
But this time, unlike the previous two, she does not have Christian to dump

00:37:37.498 --> 00:37:38.890
her emotional baggage onto.

00:37:38.970 --> 00:37:42.206
Instead, her new family is there for her, and they all share the burden of

00:37:42.228 --> 00:37:43.266
her heartbreak together.

00:37:43.368 --> 00:37:46.738
The sound of her wailing is just like what we heard after she found out that

00:37:46.744 --> 00:37:47.454
her family died.

00:37:47.502 --> 00:37:49.620
But this time it is echoed by everyone,

00:37:52.407 --> 00:37:56.792
[Group wailing sounds]

00:37:56.792 --> 00:37:59.266
Where Christian couldn't muster enough emotion to mourn with her

00:37:59.288 --> 00:38:02.182
when Dani's parents and sister passed away, the cult makes her feel

00:38:02.236 --> 00:38:03.330
connected and held.

00:38:03.410 --> 00:38:05.958
The entire scenario says something about cults in general.

00:38:06.044 --> 00:38:09.302
The members are often people struggling with a sense of belonging, and that

00:38:09.356 --> 00:38:11.502
need to belong clouds their better judgment.

00:38:11.586 --> 00:38:15.098
After Christian realizes what he's done, he runs out to find the remains of

00:38:15.104 --> 00:38:17.462
his friends before being captured and sedated.

00:38:17.526 --> 00:38:21.226
When he awakes, Dani stands upon a stage, having been completely covered in

00:38:21.248 --> 00:38:22.982
flowers but still looking sad.

00:38:23.046 --> 00:38:25.998
This is representative of the love bombing techniques that cults have been

00:38:26.004 --> 00:38:27.866
known to use to draw new followers.

00:38:27.978 --> 00:38:31.934
The final ceremony is to involve the sacrifice of nine human bodies, four

00:38:31.972 --> 00:38:35.614
new bloods, which are Simon, Connie, Mark, and Josh, and four Hårga, 

00:38:35.652 --> 00:38:38.542
the pair of 72 year old elders and two new volunteers.

00:38:38.606 --> 00:38:42.466
The 9th and final sacrifice is set to be decided by the May Queen, either a

00:38:42.488 --> 00:38:47.868
randomly selected Hårgan or, her at this point, probably ex-boyfriend Christian.

00:38:47.868 --> 00:38:50.674
The Hårgan selection is some guy named Torbjörn who we've literally

00:38:50.722 --> 00:38:52.118
never heard of or seen before.

00:38:52.204 --> 00:38:55.462
This just goes to show how Dani's character arc is now complete.

00:38:55.596 --> 00:38:59.426
She no longer needs Christian whatsoever, and she chooses him to be placed

00:38:59.458 --> 00:39:03.078
inside a bear carcass and burned alive inside of the triangular temple.

00:39:03.174 --> 00:39:06.506
Since the two cult members who volunteered to burn were still alive, the

00:39:06.528 --> 00:39:08.474
entire cult emotes their suffering with them.

00:39:08.512 --> 00:39:12.058
As the place burns down and Dani joins her new family in the agony, the

00:39:12.064 --> 00:39:15.742
burning temple symbolizes the purging of her old life and old relationship.

00:39:15.876 --> 00:39:17.162
She is being reborn.

00:39:17.226 --> 00:39:20.666
Her trauma is being left in the past life, and once this realization hits

00:39:20.698 --> 00:39:22.910
her, all she can do is smile.

00:39:23.645 --> 00:39:30.294
♪ Triumphant Music ♪

00:39:31.350 --> 00:39:36.570
The image is a catharsis for her, and Midsommar is a catharsis for Ari Aster. 

00:39:36.570 --> 00:39:39.346
Who has been open about the film being a vent for a breakup he was

00:39:39.368 --> 00:39:40.230
going through at the time.

00:39:40.300 --> 00:39:44.321
A breakup can be cataclysmic and turn your life upside down and almost feel like a death.

00:39:44.386 --> 00:39:48.054
I wanted to make a big operatic breakup movie that felt and played as

00:39:48.092 --> 00:39:51.218
consequential as the end of a relationship feels to the parties involved.

00:39:51.314 --> 00:39:53.206
As devastating as that can be.

00:39:53.308 --> 00:39:56.726
This doesn't have to be the end of our relationship, because you can check

00:39:56.748 --> 00:39:59.638
out my analysis on King Paimon from Hereditary on the left.

00:39:59.724 --> 00:40:03.102
And you can subscribe to CZsWorld for new horrors every week.

00:40:03.156 --> 00:40:04.954
Ring the death bell for notifications.

00:40:05.002 --> 00:40:06.030
Yep, just like that.

00:40:06.100 --> 00:40:07.998
And I'll see you in the next one.

00:40:08.084 --> 00:40:09.770
Assuming we both survive.

